    "text": "Back\nCOLOSSEUM · TANKOBAN\nMANGA\nOne Piece\nAdd to Collections\nEiichiro Oda\nPublishing\n1997\n★ 9.22\n\nMonkey D. Luffy sets sail in pursuit of the legendary treasure known as One Piece. With the Straw Hat Pirates, he crosses treacherous seas, meets unlikely allies, and challenges powerful enemies on the way to becoming King of the Pirates. Along the Grand Line and into the New World, every island brings new friendships and an adventure of its own.\n\nMore\nTankoban Mode\nChapter Mode\nLanguage\nDefault · English\n▾\nLanguage settings\nCHAPTERS 1,130\nPage 1 ▾\n\nSaved chapter unavailable on this device · choose a source below\n\nChapters 1–10\n10 chapters\n↓  Download page\n1\nChapter 1 · Romance Dawn\nDownloaded\n✓\n2\nChapter 2 · They Call Him Straw Hat Luffy\nDownloaded\n✓\n3\nChapter 3 · Enter Zoro: Pirate Hunter\nAvailable\n↓\n4\nChapter 4 · The Great Captain Morgan\nDownloading 40%\n✕\n5\nChapter 5 · The Pirate King and the Master Swordsman\nAvailable\n↓\n6\nChapter 6 · The First\nFailed · Retry\n↻\n7\nChapter 7 · Friends\nAvailable\n↓\n8\nChapter 8 · Nami\nAvailable\n↓\n9\nChapter 9 · The Devil's Daughter\nAvailable\n↓\n10\nChapter 10 · The Black Cat Pirates\nAvailable\n↓",
